c of prior-art latent 17597, but 'London' is a single common token with no sub-word continuation and the sentence contains no ا→ن pair, no digit-closing punctuation, no ' of' and no 'oul' or 'ven' token, so the hypothesis predicts silence.","measured":true},{"kind":"hard_negative","prompt":"The meeting began at nine, as everyone had expected.","passed":true,"expected_active":false,"activation":0.053069,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"The comma token follows the number word ' nine' rather than a digit token, so the hypothesis's digit-closing punctuation trigger does not apply and it predicts no firing.","measured":true},{"kind":"hard_negative","prompt":"The committee approved the budget after a long debate.","passed":true,"expected_active":false,"activation":0.358125,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"The word-initial determiners ' the' and ' a' occur mid-sentence, exactly the tokens the hypothesis says sit at or below zero, so it predicts no firing.","measured":true},{"kind":"hard_negative","prompt":"# Returns the sum of the values, not the count of the items.","passed":false,"expected_active":false,"activation":1.374114,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Places ' of' twice and several commas in a code comment, with no character-run continuation, no digit closing, and no claimed fragment, so the hypothesis predicts silence and a firing would suggest register effects.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"أفاد المراسل أن الجسر كان مغلقاً منذ الصباح بسبب العاصفة.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":2.178211,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"A new modern-news Arabic context in which the clean alef token ا is directly followed by the clean nūn token ن in كان, the claimed pair that the hypothesis says fires at 1.65-1.97 in every context.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"سكنت العائلة في الشقة الثانية من المبنى الجديد.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.751789,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Contains the clean token pair ا→ن inside الثانية well past the first token, in an ordinary household sentence unlike the Wikipedia fragments, which the hypothesis says fires whatever the meaning.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"서울의 봄은 따뜻하고 꽃이 많이 핍니다.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":0.636351,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"New Korean prose whose tokens are all multi-byte fragments of Hangul syllables, exactly the byte fragments the hypothesis claims as strong triggers, in a genre and language pair absent from the top examples.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"วันนี้อากาศดีมากและผู้คนออกมาเดินเล่นกัน","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":0.947549,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Thai text supplies a run of byte-fragment tokens inside Thai characters, testing the script-general part of the trigger claim on a fresh sentence.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"北京的秋天非常美丽，游客很多。","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":0.882647,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Chinese CJK characters are the third claimed byte-fragment script, and the token list shows the sentence is mostly multi-byte character fragments in a travel-description context the scan corpus examples do not contain.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"A photograph by Sadoul was sold at auction in Paris.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.534479,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"The token list confirms the claimed continuation piece 'oul' appears as its own token after ' Sad' in a completely new sentence and register (auction report), which the hypothesis predicts should fire.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"The engineer cited Thevenot's circuit theorem during the seminar.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.683408,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"The token list confirms the claimed continuation piece 'ven' appears as its own token between ' The' and 'ot', the same 'The'+'ven' morphology as the claimed Thevenin example, in a new technical context.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"By 1963, the bridge had carried a million vehicles.","passed":false,"expected_active":true,"activation":0.057932,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"The comma is a separate token immediately after the digit token ' 1963', the claimed digit-closing punctuation trigger, in a fresh sentence where the hypothesis predicts it fires.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"The Watson Institute of International Studies opened its doors in the autumn.","passed":false,"expected_active":true,"activation":0.063033,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"The token ' of' follows the capitalised proper-noun token ' Institute' much as in the PopCulture.com Terms of Service example, and the hypothesis lists ' of' as an activating token, so it predicts firing here.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"On the morning of the inspection the supervisor arrived early and asked the crew to review the checklist before any work started. The checklist had been prepared by the safety office during the previous quarter, and it covered every step of the procedure from the initial survey to the final sign-off. Each member of the crew read the document in turn, initialled the pages, and handed them back to the supervisor. He then explained that the schedule had slipped because the supplier had delivered the wrong gauge of cable. Nobody complained, although several workers had already spent an hour cutting conduit to length. The cable arrived just after lunch, wrapped in plastic and stacked on two pallets near the loading bay. A young apprentice noticed that the labels on the pallets did not match the order form, and she pointed this out to the foreman. The foreman checked the paperwork twice, called the supplier, and confirmed that the delivery belonged to a different site. He asked the crew to move the pallets to one side so that the aisle would stay clear. The afternoon passed slowly. The electricians finished the first run of conduit and began pulling wire through the bends, while the plumbers argued about the position of a valve that nobody could find on the drawing. At half past three the site manager walked through the building with a clipboard and a camera, stopping every few metres to photograph the work. She told the supervisor that the client would visit on Friday and that the floors needed to be swept before then. The crew swept the floors, cleared the offcuts into a skip, and stacked the spare materials against the wall. By the time the light began to fade the building was quiet again, and the only sound came from a radio in the site office. The supervisor wrote a short note in the log, signed it, and locked the door behind him. He drove home through traffic that moved in short, jerky bursts, thinking about the paperwork he still had to finish before the weekend. When he reached his house he made tea, sat at the kitchen table, and opened the folder that he had carried with him all day. The client arrived on Friday with two colleagues and a list of questions about the drainage. They walked the site for an hour, asked about the depth of the trench and the grade of the fall, and took photographs of the pipework before it was covered. The supervisor answered each question from memory and promised to send the drawings by email on Monday. Nobody mentioned the delay, and the meeting ended with a handshake and a brief discussion about the weather. On the following Tuesday the office received a letter confirming that the work had been accepted, subject to a final inspection in the spring. The crew moved on to another job across town, and the building sat empty for several months while the owners waited for a tenant. The crew finally finished the job in 1987, three days behind schedule.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.18121,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"A long workplace-narrative passage of roughly 700 tokens from a different genre than the scan corpus, whose token list confirms the only claimed trigger is the comma token immediately after the digit token ' 1987' near the end, so the hypothesis predicts firing deep in the context.","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"وصل الخبر بعد الحرب العالمية الثانية مباشرة -> وصل الخبر بعد الحرب العالمية الأولى مباشرة","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.591,"observed_delta":0.590755,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"الحرب العالمية الثانية -> الحرب العالمية الأولى","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.773,"observed_delta":0.772855,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"كانت السماء صافية أمس -> كانت الليلة هادئة أمس","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.0,"observed_delta":0.0,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"The report was signed by Georges Sadoul yesterday. -> The report was signed by John Smith yesterday.","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.609,"observed_delta":0.608776,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"He scored 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5 points. -> He scored one, two, three, four and five points.","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.289,"observed_delta":0.289464,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"최적의 태블릿을 통한 생산성 강화 -> The best tablet for productivity at work","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.619,"observed_delta":0.61938,"detail":"","me